Package: ggsegverse
Title: Easily Install and Load the 'ggsegverse' Brain Visualization
    Ecosystem
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Athanasia Mo", "Mowinckel",
            email = "a.m.mowinckel@psykologi.uio.no",
            role = c("aut", "cre"),
            comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5756-0223")),
    person("Center for Lifespan Changes in Brain and Cognition (LCBC), University of Oslo",
           role = "cph")
  )
Description: Installs and loads the core packages of the 'ggsegverse',
    an ecosystem for plotting brain atlases and mapping data onto brain
    regions in 2D and 3D, together with 'ggplot2', in a single call.
    Also provides helpers to find and install atlas packages, report
    package versions, and detect namespace conflicts. Learn more about
    the 'ggsegverse' ecosystem at <https://ggsegverse.github.io/ggsegverse/>.
